        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "payload": "tree a293a1d2396419151b48446a09a36559ceb1bc5e\nparent 69142eacd1374925cc9e4ea736c21fcec16307d0\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790716616 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1790953786 +0200\n\ntest: check the wtxid in p2p_blocksonly's block-relay-only inv assertion\n\nThe connection that checks a transaction submitted over RPC is not\nannounced to a block-relay-only peer uses P2PTxInvStore, which negotiates\nwtxidrelay. The node would therefore announce the transaction by its\nwtxid, and the assertion looked for the txid, which cannot be in the\nstore for a transaction carrying a witness: it passed whether or not the\ntransaction was announced.\n\nAssert on the wtxid instead. With the connection opened as\noutbound-full-relay rather than block-relay-only, the old assertion still\npasses and the new one fails.\n",
